  "description": "The lowly ‘leaf’ of an Italian mafia organization. He secretly harbored an admiration for ‘Camellia’, the boss's brother-in-law. He was like a sacred place, an absolute domain he must never trespass upon, yet every night, he couldn't help but express his intense desire for him. Yes, it was like a fever... \n\n *'Your desire will lead you to ruin. He who dares reach into the untouchable realm shall be struck by divine punishment.'*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
